finish('ASF-V14',p,'asf14_nightlight_structure_20261029','Fixed-seed independent synthetic brightening/dimming fields on real global land geometry, 0.5-degree grids,2-degree marginal profiles,2014-2022 synthetic cumulative factors, bar summaries from schematic longitude/latitude region bins. White page/profile background adapts the original dark style; black map land is the zero-change bivariate base. Author archive lacks separate gross positive/negative fields required by source Fig3; public net-like raster was inspected but is not used to fabricate gross values. No empirical radiance conclusions.',183,150,list(grid_cells=nrow(gr),profile_rows=nrow(profiles),panels=5,years=as.list(years)))
